# --- Room 1/22 ---
dig Crystal Caverns - Entrance
@desc You enter a ancient grotto where glowing crystal crystals pulse with a faint inner moonlight. You notice ancient runes carved into the stone floor, and the air hums with darkened energy.
@tags/set room-zone:crystal_caverns
@open south=south to Crystal Caverns - Path 3
@open east=east to Crystal Caverns - Ascent

